  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "When attempting to perform a conditional update without server managed triples using an ETag and If-Match, Fedora 6 always returns 412 - Precondition Failed.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": " ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "To recreate:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "Get the Etag for a representation without server managed triples:",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
         "attrs": {
          "language": "java"
         },
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "$ curl -sSI -H \"Accept: application/ld+json\" -H 'Prefer: return=representation; omit=\"http://fedora.info/definitions",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "codeBlock"
        },
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "code"
            }
           ],
           "text": "/v4/repository#ServerManaged\"' [http://example.org/fcrepo/rest/path/to/resource] | grep Etag | cut -d '/' -f 2",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "bulletList"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ],
       "text": "\"6EE1808846332B561426844981C370A0\"",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "Get the same representation and write it to a file:",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
         "attrs": {
          "language": "java"
         },
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "$ curl -H \"Accept: application/ld+json\" -H 'Prefer: return=representation; omit=\"http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#ServerManaged\"' http://example.org/fcrepo/rest/path/to/resource > test.json",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "codeBlock"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "bulletList"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "Edit the file and change some RDF.",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "Try and PUT it back using `If-Match`:",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
         "attrs": {
          "language": "java"
         },
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "$ curl -X PUT -H 'Authorization: XXX' -H 'Content-Type: application/ld+json' -H 'Prefer: handling=lenient' -H 'If-Match: \"6EE1808846332B561426844981C370A0\"' --data-binary @test.json http://example.org/fcrepo/rest/path/to/resource\r\n\r\nRequest failed due to unspecified failed precondition",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "codeBlock"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "bulletList"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "It is unclear if this is a bug in how the ETags are generated or if I'm just not providing the correct Prefer header with the PUT request.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
